      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Publisher (07) with images\nEvery 15 min, max 1 post per 20h. Only rows YOU set to **Approved**.\n1. Image `<post_id>.png` in Guardian Images > posts with image.\n2. No image yet > stamps `approved_at`, Slack asks for the image, waits up to 24h, then posts text-only.\n3. Over 3000 chars > back to Content Studio as Rejected (auto-rewrite).\nThe old 07 must be unpublished before this one is published.",
        "height": 240,
